From such date as may be fixed by the State Government by notification in the Official Gazette in this behalf, no person shall himself or by any other person on his behalf (a). manufacture for sale or for distribution, or sell, or stock or exhibit or offer for sale or distribute (i) any drug which is not of a standard quality, or is misbranded, adulterated or spurious;
Section 27(d):-
27. Penalty for manufacture, sale, etc., of drugs in contravention of this Chapter.
